1
00:01:15,560 --> 00:01:16,680
Liu Heizi.

2
00:01:26,840 --> 00:01:27,960
What skills.

3
00:01:44,240 --> 00:01:44,880
Old man.

4
00:01:54,360 --> 00:01:55,200
Take them down!

5
00:01:55,200 --> 00:01:55,729
Yes, sir.

6
00:02:07,520 --> 00:02:08,759
Tie these men up.

7
00:02:09,039 --> 00:02:10,400
Keep a close eye on them.

8
00:02:10,720 --> 00:02:13,200
Report to me immediately if there's any problem.

9
00:02:13,200 --> 00:02:13,880
Today, Chai Jiu

10
00:02:13,880 --> 00:02:14,720
disobeyed orders

11
00:02:14,720 --> 00:02:15,980
and shall be punished.

12
00:02:16,160 --> 00:02:17,160
Tie him up as well.

13
00:02:17,760 --> 00:02:19,090
I still have use for him.

14
00:02:19,640 --> 00:02:21,040
The rebellion in the south has been suppressed,

15
00:02:21,040 --> 00:02:22,680
with continuous reports of victory.

16
00:02:22,680 --> 00:02:24,079
General Tong

17
00:02:24,480 --> 00:02:27,040
is getting too much attention.

18
00:02:27,160 --> 00:02:28,560
As long as there is a war,

19
00:02:28,640 --> 00:02:30,960
the General won't be in the capital.

20
00:02:31,360 --> 00:02:32,120
His Majesty

21
00:02:32,440 --> 00:02:34,960
will still rely on you more in the future.

22
00:02:34,960 --> 00:02:36,560
Don't worry, Grand Eunuch.

23
00:02:39,120 --> 00:02:39,840
Water.

24
00:02:40,360 --> 00:02:42,020
Stand up straight and behave.

25
00:02:42,320 --> 00:02:43,780
Speak up if you want water.

26
00:03:14,280 --> 00:03:15,360
Answer honestly

27
00:03:15,720 --> 00:03:17,000
when Commander Chu asks.

28
00:03:17,000 --> 00:03:17,800
Meng Qian.

29
00:03:17,880 --> 00:03:19,240
A native of Bianjing,

30
00:03:19,280 --> 00:03:20,880
living in Anren Ward.

31
00:03:21,160 --> 00:03:23,160
Known as the Tokyo Geography Ghost.

32
00:03:23,320 --> 00:03:25,840
You have a widowed sister-in-law who sells sachets

33
00:03:25,840 --> 00:03:28,040
and a bedridden sister.

34
00:03:28,360 --> 00:03:28,880
My lord,

35
00:03:29,040 --> 00:03:30,120
they don't know anything.

36
00:03:30,120 --> 00:03:31,320
What do you want to know?

37
00:03:31,320 --> 00:03:32,160
Ask me.

38
00:03:32,440 --> 00:03:34,560
Then tell me everything.

39
00:03:35,200 --> 00:03:36,520
If you lie,

40
00:03:37,000 --> 00:03:39,520
I will immediately invite your sister-in-law and sister here.

41
00:03:39,520 --> 00:03:41,050
I will tell you everything.

42
00:03:41,280 --> 00:03:43,210
Why were you at Wuyou City that day?

43
00:03:43,320 --> 00:03:44,600
Who were your companions?

44
00:03:44,600 --> 00:03:45,660
What is this about?

45
00:03:45,760 --> 00:03:46,620
Tell the truth.

46
00:03:47,800 --> 00:03:48,200
I...

47
00:03:48,640 --> 00:03:49,300
Commander.

48
00:03:49,360 --> 00:03:50,920
Lord Zhou You is in Fengsheng Hall.

49
00:03:50,920 --> 00:03:52,650
Please go see him immediately.

50
00:04:01,400 --> 00:04:02,520
I am Chu Sanniang.

51
00:04:03,040 --> 00:04:04,280
Greetings, Lord Zhou.

52
00:04:04,280 --> 00:04:05,160
Commander Chu.

53
00:04:05,440 --> 00:04:06,440
I heard

54
00:04:06,720 --> 00:04:09,760
you led your men on a killing spree in the market today

55
00:04:10,040 --> 00:04:11,720
and made a huge scene.

56
00:04:12,120 --> 00:04:13,440
Is that true?

57
00:04:14,120 --> 00:04:15,240
Reporting to Duke Zhou.

58
00:04:15,240 --> 00:04:16,880
Last night outside Dongjing,

59
00:04:16,880 --> 00:04:17,920
two heralds

60
00:04:18,160 --> 00:04:19,640
were brutally assassinated.

61
00:04:19,640 --> 00:04:20,560
I am worried

62
00:04:20,720 --> 00:04:22,880
that this involves the Emperor's safety on the Lantern Festival.

63
00:04:22,880 --> 00:04:24,140
So I followed the clues

64
00:04:24,320 --> 00:04:26,520
to track down the assassins and rebels.

65
00:04:26,760 --> 00:04:27,890
This is ciphertext.

66
00:04:33,520 --> 00:04:34,380
Your Highness.

67
00:04:34,840 --> 00:04:35,960
The Liangshan rebels

68
00:04:35,960 --> 00:04:37,560
entered Wuyou City to trade.

69
00:04:38,120 --> 00:04:40,920
They must have come for this military defense map.

70
00:04:41,680 --> 00:04:44,409
The rebels want to climb the West Tower of Fanlou.

71
00:04:45,520 --> 00:04:47,080
It is quite interesting.

72
00:04:47,720 --> 00:04:48,480
Then,

73
00:04:48,880 --> 00:04:50,540
this military defense map...

74
00:04:50,920 --> 00:04:51,980
Let's wait and see.

75
00:04:55,159 --> 00:04:55,890
Ridiculous!

76
00:04:56,200 --> 00:04:57,080
Rebellions across the country

77
00:04:57,080 --> 00:04:58,240
have all been defeated by our army,

78
00:04:58,240 --> 00:04:59,320
retreating continuously

79
00:04:59,320 --> 00:05:00,380
and surrendering.

80
00:05:00,480 --> 00:05:02,810
What rebel would dare to come to Dongjing?

81
00:05:03,000 --> 00:05:04,130
Report to Lord Zhou,

82
00:05:04,720 --> 00:05:05,400
I

83
00:05:05,520 --> 00:05:07,080
have indeed found out through investigation

84
00:05:07,080 --> 00:05:09,080
that assassins have sneaked into Dongjing City,

85
00:05:09,080 --> 00:05:10,240
intending to do something unlawful to the Emperor

86
00:05:10,240 --> 00:05:12,160
on the night of the Shangyuan Festival.

87
00:05:12,160 --> 00:05:14,360
This matter concerns the safety of the Emperor,

88
00:05:14,360 --> 00:05:16,720
which is the responsibility of Bingjingwu.

89
00:05:16,720 --> 00:05:17,280
I

90
00:05:17,840 --> 00:05:18,800
dare not neglect it.

91
00:05:18,800 --> 00:05:19,930
You should know that

92
00:05:20,000 --> 00:05:22,240
while the Emperor's safety is naturally important,

93
00:05:22,240 --> 00:05:23,200
his reputation

94
00:05:23,440 --> 00:05:24,840
must also be maintained.

95
00:05:25,280 --> 00:05:26,160
The Shangyuan Festival

96
00:05:26,160 --> 00:05:28,520
is a joyous occasion celebrated by all.

97
00:05:28,800 --> 00:05:31,600
Moreover, envoys from Liao, Jin, and Goryeo

98
00:05:31,760 --> 00:05:33,600
are gathering in Dongjing City.

99
00:05:33,920 --> 00:05:35,440
How could our great Song Dynasty

100
00:05:35,440 --> 00:05:36,960
let these barbarians

101
00:05:36,960 --> 00:05:38,090
make a joke out of us?

102
00:05:38,280 --> 00:05:38,800
Then,

103
00:05:39,320 --> 00:05:40,720
what do you mean, My Lord?

104
00:05:41,120 --> 00:05:42,360
This year on the Shangyuan Festival,

105
00:05:42,360 --> 00:05:44,200
the Emperor is going up Fanlou again.

106
00:05:44,200 --> 00:05:45,000
The rumors of an assassination

107
00:05:45,000 --> 00:05:47,130
are about to spread all over Dongjing.

108
00:05:47,840 --> 00:05:49,159
The Emperor loves to have fun.

109
00:05:49,159 --> 00:05:50,320
Let him be.

110
00:05:51,159 --> 00:05:52,840
Assassins appear from time to time,

111
00:05:52,840 --> 00:05:55,760
but I haven't seen many who can get near the Emperor.

112
00:05:55,880 --> 00:05:56,800
This time the rumor says

113
00:05:56,800 --> 00:05:58,800
they are rebels from the uprisings.

114
00:05:58,880 --> 00:05:59,880
Bingjingwu

115
00:06:00,480 --> 00:06:02,280
has already caused quite a stir.

116
00:06:02,840 --> 00:06:04,770
The hard chore of catching thieves

117
00:06:04,880 --> 00:06:06,440
is mostly a waste of effort.

118
00:06:06,880 --> 00:06:09,680
Since Capital Chief Chu loves to waste her effort,

119
00:06:09,840 --> 00:06:11,840
let her work to her heart's content.

120
00:06:12,280 --> 00:06:12,920
What if

121
00:06:13,200 --> 00:06:15,000
she really catches the thieves?

122
00:06:15,400 --> 00:06:17,600
She can report directly to the Emperor.

123
00:06:17,960 --> 00:06:19,560
Catching thieves is hard.

124
00:06:19,840 --> 00:06:21,120
But once the thieves are caught,

125
00:06:21,120 --> 00:06:22,960
snatching them away to claim credit

126
00:06:22,960 --> 00:06:25,640
is a piece of cake, isn't it?

127
00:06:26,480 --> 00:06:27,480
Commander Chu,

128
00:06:27,840 --> 00:06:28,680
right now,

129
00:06:28,960 --> 00:06:31,160
factions inside and outside the court are surging.

130
00:06:31,160 --> 00:06:33,320
Everyone has their own schemes in fighting for power.

131
00:06:33,320 --> 00:06:35,400
Your Ice Well Bureau works single-mindedly,

132
00:06:35,400 --> 00:06:36,840
relying on no faction.

133
00:06:37,320 --> 00:06:38,680
If such a major event

134
00:06:38,680 --> 00:06:41,040
as the assassination of the Emperor really happens,

135
00:06:41,040 --> 00:06:42,360
all the blame

136
00:06:42,560 --> 00:06:44,120
will be pushed onto you.

137
00:06:44,600 --> 00:06:45,520
If there is any credit,

138
00:06:45,520 --> 00:06:47,250
it will certainly not be yours.

139
00:06:47,320 --> 00:06:48,880
It is a thankless task.

140
00:06:49,040 --> 00:06:50,120
Do you understand?

141
00:06:51,120 --> 00:06:52,250
Thank you, Mr. Zhou.

142
00:06:52,680 --> 00:06:53,880
I will keep it in mind.

143
00:06:55,280 --> 00:06:57,600
Commander Chu, since you understand,

144
00:06:57,920 --> 00:07:01,400
stop arresting innocent citizens of Dongjing indiscriminately.

145
00:07:01,400 --> 00:07:02,760
Those who should be released,

146
00:07:02,760 --> 00:07:03,840
release them all.

147
00:07:05,920 --> 00:07:07,050
Farewell, Mr. Zhou.

148
00:07:14,720 --> 00:07:15,880
Release them.

149
00:07:19,880 --> 00:07:21,040
I ask you,

150
00:07:21,440 --> 00:07:23,120
the Taoist who coerced you,

151
00:07:23,440 --> 00:07:25,640
did he have a mole between his eyebrows?

152
00:07:25,880 --> 00:07:26,440
My lord.

153
00:07:30,320 --> 00:07:31,840
If you want to make a contribution,

154
00:07:31,840 --> 00:07:32,480
he did.

155
00:07:33,200 --> 00:07:33,920
And if not?

156
00:07:34,600 --> 00:07:35,200
He didn't.

157
00:07:35,440 --> 00:07:36,170
How dare you!

158
00:07:36,320 --> 00:07:36,840
My lord,

159
00:07:37,560 --> 00:07:39,440
that Taoist has the compound surname Situ.

160
00:07:39,440 --> 00:07:41,970
In my judgment, he might be a Liangshan rebel.

161
00:07:42,520 --> 00:07:44,200
Give me a chance to atone for my crimes.

162
00:07:44,200 --> 00:07:46,200
I know their possible future moves.

163
00:07:46,360 --> 00:07:47,159
Let me help you

164
00:07:48,080 --> 00:07:49,080
catch the rebels.

165
00:07:50,080 --> 00:07:50,740
Commander.

166
00:07:51,080 --> 00:07:51,940
Lord Zhou's men

167
00:07:52,159 --> 00:07:53,020
have returned.

168
00:07:53,280 --> 00:07:54,080
They only asked

169
00:07:54,080 --> 00:07:55,540
if we released the people.

170
00:07:56,200 --> 00:07:57,000
I am

171
00:07:57,920 --> 00:07:59,250
only passing a message.

172
00:08:01,120 --> 00:08:02,840
It concerns His Majesty's safety.

173
00:08:02,840 --> 00:08:03,800
If we don't catch the thieves,

174
00:08:03,800 --> 00:08:06,800
no one is allowed to leave.

175
00:08:08,040 --> 00:08:09,200
Take them away.

176
00:08:15,720 --> 00:08:16,360
It's a bit tight.

177
00:08:16,360 --> 00:08:17,120
Be gentle.

178
00:08:21,120 --> 00:08:21,580
Old man,

179
00:08:21,920 --> 00:08:23,250
you saved my life again.

180
00:08:24,440 --> 00:08:25,320
I guessed

181
00:08:25,960 --> 00:08:27,920
you weren't with those people.

182
00:08:28,640 --> 00:08:29,840
If Lord Zhou wants to release them,

183
00:08:29,840 --> 00:08:32,200
couldn't you find an excuse to send them away?

184
00:08:32,200 --> 00:08:33,659
Do I have to teach you this?

185
00:08:33,720 --> 00:08:35,520
Can't you even stall for an hour?

186
00:08:36,360 --> 00:08:38,400
But Lord Zhou...

187
00:08:38,760 --> 00:08:39,960
Whose side are you on?

188
00:08:40,080 --> 00:08:42,010
Keep interrogating those people.

189
00:08:50,080 --> 00:08:51,080
You're the one

190
00:08:51,240 --> 00:08:52,570
who used the Fire Escape

191
00:08:52,880 --> 00:08:54,410
to scare away Jackal Uncle.

192
00:08:55,360 --> 00:08:56,080
Daughter.

193
00:08:56,480 --> 00:08:57,080
Daughter.

194
00:08:57,280 --> 00:08:58,040
How dare you!

195
00:08:59,000 --> 00:08:59,400
No,

196
00:08:59,560 --> 00:09:00,020
My Lord.

197
00:09:00,720 --> 00:09:02,120
Forgive my presumption.

198
00:09:02,360 --> 00:09:05,120
If it weren't for your skill in the Fire Escape,

199
00:09:05,840 --> 00:09:07,920
you would be tortured by now.

200
00:09:07,960 --> 00:09:09,820
You really look like my daughter.

201
00:09:10,080 --> 00:09:11,920
Do you have a death wish?

202
00:09:12,120 --> 00:09:12,360
No.

203
00:09:12,360 --> 00:09:13,320
Tell the truth.

204
00:09:13,840 --> 00:09:15,160
Who exactly are you,

205
00:09:15,760 --> 00:09:16,920
and what is your relationship

206
00:09:16,920 --> 00:09:18,320
with those people in the cave?

207
00:09:18,320 --> 00:09:19,560
My name is Zhu Zitong.

208
00:09:20,040 --> 00:09:20,840
In the past,

209
00:09:22,000 --> 00:09:23,460
I roamed the martial world

210
00:09:24,680 --> 00:09:26,880
and made a living as a street performer.

211
00:09:26,920 --> 00:09:28,760
Because of my skill in the Fire Escape,

212
00:09:28,760 --> 00:09:30,290
people in the martial world

213
00:09:30,440 --> 00:09:31,440
call me Fire Sanlang.
